{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"113342","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/113342","key":"MC-152966","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"25/May/19 7:59 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Villages spawn rate since 1.11 to 1.14 is like an infestation.</p>\n\n<p>here are some examples&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Seed : -7273534702661314127</p>\n\n<p>1.14 : <b>82</b> Villages</p>\n\n<p>1.10 : 32 Villages</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Seed : 5324560665388954678</p>\n\n<p>1.14 : <b>92</b> Villages!</p>\n\n<p>1.10 : 31 Villages</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>( small note : i noticed that villages density in deserts especially have top of the roof spawn rate :</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>to get this glitch load a world in 1.10 and use the same seed in 1.11 to 1.14 and you will notice the difference in villages. Admist is a great program to see the difference easily.</p>\n\n<p>hopefully i have provided enough information for this bug to be fixed once and for all, and thanks for the support CubeTheThird&nbsp;♥</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>( pics down )</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"18/Dec/20 1:46 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/150482","id":"150482","filename":"Screenshot (6).png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secur